 ('crs-asset-state-housing-estate-calabar','State Housing Estate, Calabar',ARRAY['State Housing Calabar'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Lands / CROSPIL','Calabar Municipal','State Housing','reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Bureau%20of%20Statistics/formatted%20Personal%20F%26F%20FINAL%20PRINT-1.pdf','source_found','The official 2024 government-property schedule locates state residential quarters in State Housing Estate, Calabar; the estate plan and public/private parcel schedule are not published.',1,'Established urban estate containing government property and nearby private occupation requires parcel-level separation.'),
 ('crs-asset-okuku-gra-housing-estate','Okuku GRA Housing Estate project',ARRAY['Okuku world class GRA Housing Estate'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Housing','Yala','Okuku','reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Budget/CROSS%20RIVER%20STATE%202026%20APPROVED%20BUDGET.pdf','source_found','Named in the official 2025/2026 budget; the entry does not establish completion, tenure or site extent.',1,'Planned government layout can be confused with surrounding market land before its acquisition and layout plans are public.'),
 ('crs-asset-obanliku-gra-housing-estate','Obanliku GRA Housing Estate project',ARRAY['Obanliku world class GRA Housing Estate'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Housing','Obanliku',NULL,'reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Budget/CROSS%20RIVER%20STATE%202026%20APPROVED%20BUDGET.pdf','source_found','Named in the official 2025/2026 budget at LGA level; exact locality, completion, tenure and site extent are not stated.',1,'Unresolved government housing site must be identified before nearby plots can be assessed.'),
