 ('crs-asset-odukpani-gra-housing-estate','Odukpani GRA Housing Estate project',ARRAY['Odukpani world class GRA Housing Estate'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Housing','Odukpani',NULL,'reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Budget/CROSS%20RIVER%20STATE%202026%20APPROVED%20BUDGET.pdf','source_found','Named in the official 2025/2026 budget, including a 2026 allocation; exact locality, tenure and site extent are not stated.',1,'Fast-growing Calabar fringe makes an unresolved government housing acquisition particularly exposed to conflicting sales.'),
 ('crs-asset-yala-vulnerable-social-housing','Yala 1,000-unit social housing scheme',ARRAY['1,000 units Social Housing for the vulnerable'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Housing','Yala',NULL,'reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Budget/CROSS%20RIVER%20STATE%202026%20APPROVED%20BUDGET.pdf','source_found','Separately named and funded in the official budget with recorded 2025 performance; no town, site plan or land schedule is supplied.',2,'A large housing programme implies a land holding, but it must not be merged with another Yala housing project without evidence.'),
 ('crs-asset-yala-rent-to-own-housing','Yala 500-unit rent-to-own housing scheme',ARRAY['500 Rent to own low cost social housing scheme for Civil/Public Servants'],'government_layout','Cross River State Ministry of Housing','Yala',NULL,'reported',NULL,'https://www.crossriverstate.gov.ng/download/Budget/CROSS%20RIVER%20STATE%202026%20APPROVED%20BUDGET.pdf','source_found','Separately named and funded in the official budget with recorded 2025 performance; no town, site plan or land schedule is supplied.',2,'Separate programme identity is retained until evidence proves whether it shares a site with another Yala scheme.'),
 ('crs-asset-adiabo-womens-housing','Adiabo federal women''s housing scheme land',ARRAY['Adiabo women housing scheme','Family Homes Funds Adiabo site'],'government_layout','Cross River State Government / Family Homes Funds','Odukpani','Adiabo','reported',310000::numeric,'https://news.crossriverstate.gov.ng/c-river-govt-hands-over-31-hectares-of-land-to-firm-for-fg-womens-housing-scheme/','source_found','Official state report records handover of 31 hectares for a 70-unit federal women''s housing scheme; it publishes no survey plan or coordinates.',1,'A named 31-hectare government-backed housing site on the Calabar fringe has direct overlap and fraudulent-sale relevance.'),
